```

- **Id:** I used the existing `CombGuid.Generate()` in `src/Libraries/Data/Utilities/CombGuid.cs` instead of writing new byte-packing code. It already writes the UTC day count and milliseconds into the last six bytes in SQL Server's comparison order, and it has tests. The obsolete `CoreHelpers.GenerateComb()` delegates to it too.
